// Sensitive.xcconfig.example — COMMITTED TEMPLATE
//
// The real file (XCConfigs/Sensitive.xcconfig) is git-ignored and lives only on your machine.
// Other xcconfigs reference it by relative path, so the real file MUST exist before
// `tuist generate`. Create it from this template:
//
//   cp XCConfigs/Sensitive.xcconfig.example XCConfigs/Sensitive.xcconfig
//
// Then fill in local-only secrets below. NEVER commit real keys.

// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

// ── Supabase (Phase 2 backend) ──
// Leave these blank to run on the in-memory mock store.
// ⚠️ xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so put the HOST ONLY (no "https://").
//    The app prepends https:// (see InfoPlists/TraceAppInfo.plist → SUPABASE_URL).
//    From Supabase: Project Settings → API → Project URL (drop the https://) + anon public key.
// SUPABASE_HOST = your-project-ref.supabase.co
// SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = eyJhbGciOi...
